// DataTable - Reusable table components for SwiftUI
//
// Components:
//   DataTableContainer  - Wraps Table with footer, copy, export
//   DataTableFooter     - Footer bar with count + selection info
//   TableExporter       - CSV/TSV export utilities
//   ColumnToggleMenu    - Column visibility toggle UI
//   SortIndicator       - Sort direction indicator for custom headers
//
// Modifiers:
//   .copyableTable(formatter:) - Adds Cmd+C support to any view
